--- !u!114 &1798818511
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1798818509}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 00034fb81fa20b34d8d200b1b66345f4, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::HollowCreek.Interaction.InteractableNote
  promptText: Read journal
  interactionRange: 3
  enableHighlight: 1
  highlightColor: {r: 1, g: 0.9, b: 0.5, a: 1}
  highlightIntensity: 0.3
  noteTitle: Old Journal Entry
  noteText: 'September 14th


    I found something strange in the barn today. The
    symbols carved into the wall don''t match anything I''ve seen before, and the
    carving feels fresh. Too fresh.


    I tried to trace one of the lines, but
    my skin went cold the moment I touched it. The lantern flickered. I told myself
    it was just the wind.


    I need to investigate further. Tomorrow, I''ll go
    back with a better light and maybe take a photograph for the records. Something
    tells me this isn''t the last we''ll see of those marks.


    Along the way
    I noticed the cellar door was open again. No one else is supposed to be here
    this week. I swear I locked it on Sunday.


    Whatever is down there... I think
    it''s been watching me through the cracks.'
  displayAsFullSheet: 1
  displaySeconds: 25
